Package: slcflights
Title: Salt Lake City Flight Records and Supporting Airport Coordinates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksey", "Kulyukin", , "aleksey.kulyukin.2022@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides packaged Parquet files for Salt Lake City-related U.S. 
    flight records and a CSV table containing coordinates for the airports 
    referenced in those records. The flight records are derived from the Bureau 
    of Transportation Statistics (BTS) TranStats On-Time Performance data, and
    the coordinate table is derived from the BTS TranStats Master Coordinate
    support table. Includes helper functions to list available years, read 
    selected years into memory, and open the packaged Parquet files lazily for 
    downstream analysis. 
